    },
    {
      "text": "Subdivision of 3.85 acres into 14 lots: 12 building lots (two 3-unit, three 4-unit, five 5-unit and two 6-unit buildings) plus a stormwater lot and an open space lot. Staff reports: four unit types, all three-bedroom, 1,728 to 2,392 sq ft with the ADUs; the city project page lists 2,170 to 2,864 sq ft.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003311",
        "SRC-003312",
        "SRC-001560"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Planning Commission voted unanimously on 2026-10-14 to deny the project as \"objectively unsafe\"; the applicant appealed on 2026-10-15. CEQA: statutorily exempt under Public Resources Code 21080.66 (AB 130). Site zoned R-1-10,000, General Plan Medium Density Residential (M-10).",
